plush.intro.page1=Stop shaking me! Yes, me, the plush in your pocket. Name's Grizzle.
plush.intro.page2=I was a miner's plush, deep under the goblin hills. Copper, silver, gold: I ate it all, and in return I knew every way back to daylight.
plush.intro.page3=Now I am starving and stitched up like a rag. Feed me, and I will show you the way up whenever you are lost below.
plush.intro.want=What do you want?
plush.intro.hush=Hush.
plush.hungry.text=Ten copper, ten silver, ten gold. Raw ore, nothing smelted. My stomach rumbles louder than a cave in.
plush.hungry.feed=Here, eat.
plush.hungry.give-up=I will not feed you.
plush.hungry.later=Later.
plush.sniff.text=Sniff... sniff... Is that gold? Do not wave it under my nose like that!
plush.sniff.answer=Patience.
plush.fed.text=Ahh, I feel like a proper plush again. Lost in the dark? Just ask.
plush.fed.up=Take me up.
plush.refused.text=Hmph. I only deal with licensed miners, and nobody signed your licence. Come back when the server says otherwise.
plush.refused.answer=Fine.
plush.fed.sad=You look sad.
plush.fed.home=Here we are, home.
plush.fed.story=Tell me your story.
plush.fed.story-again=Tell it again.
plush.fed.bye=Goodbye.
plush.story.page1=A goblin foreman sewed me from a sack of ore and the coat of his best digger.
plush.story.page2=He hung me on his belt, and every time the tunnel caved in I sniffed the way out. The crew never lost a soul.
plush.story.page3=Then the breach swallowed the whole camp, and I was left behind in the dust. Until you came along.
plush.story.answer=I see.
plush.mumble.text=Zzz... ğŏŏld... mŏŏŕe ğŏld... zzz...
plush.mumble.wake=Wake up.
